# Common Patterns

## Deep Boundaries

- Put shared contracts and worker message shapes in `packages/shared`.
- Put protobuf definitions and generated TypeScript in `packages/proto`.
- Put reusable shadcn / Tailwind primitives in `packages/ui`.
- Keep ClickHouse ingestion and gRPC producer details out of dashboard UI
  modules; the browser talks to the gateway over GraphQL and SSE only.

## Validated Contracts

Validate once at each boundary with `zod/mini` and pass typed values inward.
GraphQL and SSE success/error shapes, stream cursors, dataset versions, and
worker messages must be explicit and stable. Do not invent a generic CRUD
repository abstraction for immutable dataset versions or streamed blocks.

## Immutable Publication

Treat each Dataset Version as an immutable snapshot. Streamed Finding Blocks
are append-only for a given version and cursor; never mutate a published block
or rewrite history for an already-served sequence number.
